  "content": "[Intro]\n[C/G]A candycolored clown\nthey call the\n[Am]sandman\n[F]Tiptoes to my room every\n[G7]night\n[C/G]Just to sprinkle stardust and to\n[Am]whisper \"Go to\n[F]sleep. Every-\n[G]thing is all\n[C/G]right.\"\nI close my\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C/G]eyes,\nthen I drift a-\n[Dm]way\nInto the\n[G7]magic night,\nI softly\n[C/G]say\nA silent\nprayer\nlike dreamers\n[Dm]do\nThen I fall as-\n[G7]leep to dreams,\nmy dreams of\n[C/G]you\nIn\n\n[Verse 2]\n[C/G]dreams I\nwalk with\n[G]you,\nin\n[F]dreams I\n[G]talk to\n[C/G]you\nIn\ndreams you're\nmine,\n[D]all of the\ntime We're to-\n[C/G]ge-\n[Dm]ther [G]in\n[C/G]dreams, [Dm]in\n[G]dreams\nBut\n\n[Verse 3]\n[C/G]just be-\n[Fm]fore the\n[C/G]dawn,\nI a-\nwake and\n[Fm]find you\n[C/G]gone\nI can't\nhelp it, I can't\nhelp it, if I\n[Dm]cry\nI re-\nmember [G]that\nyou said good-\n[C/G]bye\nIt's too\nbad that\n[F]all these\n[G]things\nCan only\n[C/G]happen\n[F]in my\n[G]dreams\n\n[Outro]\n[C/G]On-\nly in\n[D]dreams,\nin\n[Dm]beau-\n[G]tiful\n[C/G]dreams",
